"Lightened by the lights around,\nHeightened by the fights around,\nBrightened by the glowing ground,\nBurning? Or just celebrating around?\n\nAsking the mind to illuminate,\nPleading the subconscious to clearly state,\nGathering information from the globe round,\nFor once in my life, clearing my mind,\nI won't lie to myself,\nFor I'll clearly dictate.\n\nLots of light, yet the soul won't glow.\nKept on thinking, yet the answer won't show.\nSike! I have potential, and yes I'll grow,\nFor those who can't drop ego, I'm not gonna bow."